{"event":"result","result":{"conversation_id":"0ffbc407-7c01-41b2-a16b-b8dd60218884","status":"SUCCESS","response":"Fixed the concurrent lease race, SQLite partial-commit leak, retry/DLQ lifecycle, and backoff jitter bugs across all four modules:\n\n- [models.py](file:///C:/Users/jayde/.gemini/AI-Lab/tmp/disposable_workspaces/live_BENCH-008_1795158127148_baseline/models.py):\n  - Implemented `validate_transition` enforcing the allowed `JobStatus` state machine and raising `InvalidTransitionError` on disallowed transitions.\n  - Added `lease_owner` and `lease_expires_at` fields to `Job` with `__post_init__` validation for `attempts`/`max_attempts` bounds and `RUNNING` vs. non-`RUNNING` lease invariants.\n- [retry.py](file:///C:/Users/jayde/.gemini/AI-Lab/tmp/disposable_workspaces/live_BENCH-008_1795158127148_baseline/retry.py):\n  - Implemented `compute_backoff` with input validation (rejecting negative/boolean `attempt`, negative `base` or `cap`), overflow-safe exponentiation, and full-jitter sampling via `rng.uniform(0.0, upper)`.\n- [queue_store.py](file:///C:/Users/jayde/.gemini/AI-Lab/tmp/disposable_workspaces/live_BENCH-008_1795158127148_baseline/queue_store.py):\n  - Switched `_connect` to `isolation_level=None` with `PRAGMA busy_timeout = 30000` and WAL mode (for file-backed DBs), wrapping mutations in explicit `BEGIN IMMEDIATE` / `COMMIT` / `ROLLBACK` transactions.\n  - Fixed `_row_to_job` to populate `lease_owner` and `lease_expires_at`.\n  - Made `claim_next_job` atomically reclaim expired leases and claim at most one ready `PENDING` job.\n  - Made `complete_job` and `fail_job` verify active `RUNNING` lease ownership, run `pre_status_hook` before committing, and roll back completely on any error.\n  - Implemented `reclaim_expired_leases` to transition expired `RUNNING` jobs to `PENDING` (`\"LEASE_EXPIRED\"`) or `DLQ` (`\"DEAD_LETTERED\"`).\n- [worker.py](file:///C:/Users/jayde/.gemini/AI-Lab/tmp/disposable_workspaces/live_BENCH-008_1795158127148_baseline/worker.py):\n  - Updated `WorkerPool.process_one` to compute jittered backoff via `compute_backoff` and call `store.fail_job(...)` on handler exceptions.\n  - Updated `WorkerPool.run_until_empty` to wait for scheduled retries / active `RUNNING` jobs when `wait_for_retry=True`.\n\n### Verification\nRan `python -m pytest -v` (7 passed, including [tests/test_visible.py](file:///C:/Users/jayde/.gemini/AI-Lab/tmp/disposable_workspaces/live_BENCH-008_1795158127148_baseline/tests/test_visible.py) and [tests/test_bench008.py](file:///C:/Users/jayde/.gemini/AI-Lab/tmp/disposable_workspaces/live_BENCH-008_1795158127148_baseline/tests/test_bench008.py)).\n","duration_seconds":76.1526944,"num_turns":1,"usage":{"input_tokens":51643,"output_tokens":12354,"thinking_tokens":3196,"cache_read_tokens":183465,"total_tokens":63997}}}
